* Control Mean Bonus: {{Control Bonus EUR / Control Enrollments}}
* Treatment Mean Bonus: {{Treatment Bonus EUR / Treatment Enrollments}}
* Control Mean GMV: {{Control GMV EUR / Control Enrollments}}
* Delta Bonus: {{Treatment Mean Bonus - Control Mean Bonus}}
* Delta GMV Cuped bootstrap: {{Delta Bonus * GMV UC from cuped bootstrap}}
* *Final Aggregated GMV UC:* {{SUM(Delta GMV Cuped bootstrap) / SUM(Delta Bonus)}}



